WEBVTT

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:36.360
Something unbelievable
has happened here!

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:41.730
The G-Revolutions, fighting for the
current world of Beyblading...

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:47.610
Have lost two in a row with
Daichi Sumeragi and Rei Kon!

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.730
Dang, this is it for us!

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:59.620
If we lose again,
it's all over!

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.850
It won't end...
I won't let it!

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.180
You mustn't give up, kids.
The battle isn't over yet!

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:23.450
Will BEGA take the win for good
with their indomitable strength?!

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.960
Or will the G-Revolutions
hold their ground?

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.380
If Max loses,
it's end of the line!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:38.320
The fated third match between Mystel
and Max Mizuhara is just ahead!

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:42.690
I can't lose.
I have to win!

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.580
Max from the G-Revolutions?

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:52.480
His defense is no match for
Mystel's 360 degree attacks.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.980
For sure.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:59.500
I guess the headline'll be "BEGA wins on the first day with no losses" then?

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.680
Excuse me!

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.610
Volkov!

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.780
Perfect.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.870
What do you
mean "perfect"?!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:18.000
I'll get straight to the point. This is boring
the audience, so try to win at least once.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.700
Obviously!

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.610
Not that we
intend to hold back.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:24.100
Don't make fun of me!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:28.850
I'm not.
Just a little bit of advice.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:33.400
There's no sense of
drama in winning 3-0.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:38.280
If the battle ends too quickly,
the people might accuse me of unfair play.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.130
Me, the pinnacle of
integrity that I am.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.010
If that's all you have
to say, I'm leaving!

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:48.770
The audience expects
Mystel to win.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:53.100
But you'll subvert their absurd
expectations, won't you?

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.410
Max, my boy.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.080
Our next opponent is Mystel.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:06.740
He's good.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.040
He can use his
small body to jump.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.020
And exerts all of
his power into his Bey.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.940
The most troublesome thing is
his rapid-fire style of attacks.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.330
Attacks from every angle.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.320
I couldn't escape him.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.050
This is a simulation.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:32.530
The defense type Draciel, and the attack type Poseidon.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:40.520
Poseidon's attack power is stronger
than Draciel's rock-hard defense.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:46.450
Attacks from every angle
will be difficult to deal with...

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:50.090
Tell me how you really feel...

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:55.600
The best strategy might be to dodge his attacks and wait for your chance.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:01.980
His defense is no match for
Mystel's 360 degree attacks.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:07.320
He can't get hit
if he wants to win.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.900
The audience expects
Mystel to win.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:14.620
It might be better to
change strategies this time.

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.500
Hold on!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:22.120
I'm glad you're excited, but Max is who's gonna be fighting out there.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.460
Yeah.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.520
Right, Max?

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.970
You don't trust me.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:35.450
You guys all think
I can't beat Mystel!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.680
What do you mean, Sensei?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:43.290
We're thinking because
we want to help you!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:46.450
I've fought with my
own style all this time.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:52.100
But you've all been talking
like you don't trust me!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.820
What would you know?!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.540
Max!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:03.520
Good battles, you two.
It's a special drink. Have some.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.340
Thank you.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.260
Thank you!

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.730
You might not
even have to play.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:13.300
You mean if we
win three in a row?

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.120
Yummy!

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:19.740
You can't tell what happens
until the battle's over.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:23.840
In Japanese, there's a saying akin to
"tighten your kabuto helmet after victory."

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.560
Tighten your kabuto
helmet after victory?

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:30.960
It means that you need to keep
your guard up, even if you win.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.820
You're so serious, Garlie!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:38.090
I'd prefer you call
me a perfectionist.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:40.450
Ming-Ming doesn't get it!

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:44.940
Either way, I want you to be
careful out there, Mystel.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.400
What do they know about me?

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:05.410
But maybe I went too far...

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.900
Rick!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.490
Come with me.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:16.640
I've never seen
him get mad before.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:20.250
It's only natural if you
consider how he feels...

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:29.290
We thought we were doing him a favor,
but it was adding extra pressure to Max...

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:33.210
He would get mad after hearing
us run our mouths like that.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.240
Max is the one who's
doing the fighting.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.200
If you want something, spit it out!

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:47.180
I'll take a hamburger and fries combo,
along with a large serving of rice and a salad.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.500
Thousand island dressing.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.760
Rick!

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:53.520
Kitsune udon for him.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.200
Don't decide for me!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.240
Kitsune soba, then?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:00.880
I'm not always in the
mood for noodles!

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:04.690
Or maybe you want
katsudon for the symbolism?

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.640
If that's all you want, I'm leaving!

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:08.850
This is pathetic.

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.980
To see you taking
it out on all of us.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:14.770
Taking it out?
It's not my fault!

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:19.060
I can't afford to lose!
Everything's riding on me!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:23.250
But all of you talk like you
don't trust me to handle it!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:29.500
You say my style of battling can't win! I can't help but worry about that!

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:34.940
So basically you don't have confidence in your defense style. You're just gonna give up?

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:41.480
That's not it! You're all saying I don't have a chance of winning with my defensive style!

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:44.300
After all, we can't
afford to lose again!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:47.010
So are you gonna
abandon your style then?

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:55.050
Time to start the third match!

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.980
The G-Revolutions stand at
zero wins and two losses!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.200
Their backs are
against the wall!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:26.280
BEGA's at two wins and zero losses!
Is this where they'll take the third win?

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:32.500
Max's defensive style will be easy
pickings for Mystel's attack style!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:39.020
Will Max have to abandon his
defensive style if he wants to win?!

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:47.210
Not going to the bench?

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.770
Nope. I already know the result.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.160
Intuition?

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.570
It's not intuition.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.700
After all...

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.820
You can't change the future.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:16.970
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.160
Max!

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:42.820
Sorry. For not
considering how you felt.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.930
We shouldn't
have said all that.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:52.420
Don't worry about it.
I'm sorry too.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.260
--Max!

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:55.970
Get on out there, Max!

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.450
OK!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.610
Show 'em all.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:11.140
I'll show 'em
I can pull it off.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.570
Look at you.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:25.040
The match is about to start.
Can you put aside the cheerleading?

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:30.180
Aww. Sorry. They got
mad at Ming-Ming!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.100
Damn it, Mystel...

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.050
He's not here yet?

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.010
Neither is Brooklyn.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.850
Typical.

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:52.020
Let's have a good time.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.490
I'm just going to
fight in my own style.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:07.210
And win! For the
future of Beyblading!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.930
--Three! Two! One!

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:15.090
Go, Shoot!

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:21.640
Both players shoot
in their fated battle!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.890
Max is attacking
right from the start!

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.890
Has he changed his style?!

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:36.420
--Max!

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.730
That's it, Draciel!

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:51.840
So basically you don't have confidence in your defense style. You're just gonna give up?

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:58.290
That's not it! You're all saying I don't have a chance of winning with my defensive style!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:01.490
After all, we can't
afford to lose again!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.080
So are you gonna
abandon your style then?

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:07.680
Suit yourself.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.900
But let me say this.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:15.370
Changing your style would mean
rejecting all you've done up to now.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.540
Rejecting all I've done?

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.740
Yeah. And your whole
way of life, too.

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:24.730
Winning by blocking all
of your opponent's attacks.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:29.290
Isn't that the style Max Mizuhara
has fought with all this time?

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:36.800
Aiming for the tiniest of paths to victory,
no matter how strong of an opponent you face.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:44.010
And you're mad because they insulted
your style of battle--your pride!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.800
Believe in your
own style, dammit.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.090
Believe in my own...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.930
Maybe I'm just butting in.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:55.250
It's your battle.
You can fight how you please.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.090
Here you go.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.490
Chow time.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.420
What's wrong?

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:10.300
I knew that there was something
wrong with changing my style.

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:13.700
I can't be so quick to
let go of it! Thank you, Rick!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:19.000
I won't change who I am!
That's how I made it this far!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.610
Right?

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.660
Your udon's gonna get soggy.

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:23.920
Oh yeah.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:30.970
Just like with Beyblade,
I can't change my style!

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:38.650
Max has abandoned
his iron-clad defense!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:41.770
Is he so determined to
win he'd change his style?!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:47.410
No, you're wrong! I'm in position
to make my ultimate defense!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:52.300
Come on, Mystel!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:07.140
Draciel's taking him on
with its usual defensive style!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.810
Is this a reckless
move against Mystel?!

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:16.060
It's not reckless!
This is my style!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:30.400
I see he's staying with his style despite the odds being against him. Has he given up?

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:42.660
Draciel's barely keeping up with
the rapid flow of Mystel's attacks!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.980
He's getting kicked
around like a sandbag!

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:03.440
Max can't get a chance to fight back!
Is this the end for the G-Revolutions?!

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:15.280
His hit-and-run strategy
is so hard to predict!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.490
Right! Left!
Up-right! Straight up!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.480
I can't keep up with him!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:25.960
I know this is Max's style, but do
you think he's taking too many hits?

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:31.960
No, it looks like Max is just
getting hit, but that's not it!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:41.800
He's sliding away so he's taking the least
amount of damage right before he's attacked!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.840
It's such a
subtle technique!

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:50.640
Take his attacks and wait
for my chance! That's my style!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.120
The future has changed.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:04.220
Poseidon on attack! Draciel on defense!
Neither is giving an inch!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:12.860
You're amazing! I've never seen anyone
dodge my attacks with such perfect timing.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.220
But how long can you last?

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:19.780
Attack as much as you want!
I'll take them on, one by one!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:27.690
Neither one of
them is letting up!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.980
Mystel's breathing pretty hard...

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.640
He's wearing himself out.

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:37.600
An iron-clad defense... It takes strength
to be so dedicated to your own style.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.960
Mystel is losing power!

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.700
If he was at 100% to start,
he's at 70% now!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:51.560
You're really amazing, you know...

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.500
You're the best!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.860
You too!

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.890
I'm beat!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:02.100
So am I.
Time to wrap this up!

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.890
Okay! But I won't lose!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.720
Both of them are
sizing each other up!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:13.720
Is this the prelude
to the finale?!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:17.220
Ocean Javelin!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:38.840
Aqua Shield!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.300
Wow!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:00.110
Are the G-Revolutions done for?!

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:03.020
Max!

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:06.330
I can't lose!
For the future of Beyblading!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:12.050
For my pride...
For Draciel's pride!

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:15.040
Is offense the
superior weapon?!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:18.760
No! Defense is
my greatest weapon!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:22.000
Go, Draciel!

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:51.600
Both players get a
Stadium Out! It's a draw!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.180
It's over...

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.380
You were great!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:05.760
A Stadium Out... A draw!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.890
To come back from such
a disadvantage... Incredible!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:13.100
We were so close!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.680
His pride for this defensive
style took him this far...

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:19.500
He put his
soul into his Bey...

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:24.760
Max, I accept your baton!
Time for our comeback!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:28.570
Fending off your opponent's
attacks and pulling off a comeback...

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:31.050
Tighten your kabuto
helmet after victory...

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:39.890
It would be boring to let it end here. I will crush
Takao Kinomiya and the G-Revolutions into dust!

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:44.700
And when I do, the era of
BEGA will be before us!

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:49.310
You changed the future.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:21:01.440
It's amazing that you were
able to fend off all my attacks!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:06.200
So are you. It took all I had
just to bring it to a draw.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.920
That was a lot of fun.

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:12.220
Thank you! I was able to
enjoy myself a lot!

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:24.960
He's pretty damn good.
He got the crowd to root for him.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:29.570
Hear that, Draciel?
They're cheering for you!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:33.370
Thank you, my friend!

00:22:55.340 --> 00:22:59.490
The tides tickling your heart.
The ebb and flow of the waves.

00:22:59.490 --> 00:23:04.120
Seagulls flying in the air!
Oh, fishing is so wonderful!

00:23:04.120 --> 00:23:06.690
But there's something even better!

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:10.770
Eyes focused on a single battle.
A strong heart dedicated to a cause!

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:13.740
A manly sense of adventure that
there's no turning back from!

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:16.450
After all, Beyblade is tres bien!

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:21.210
Let me show you.
This is my La Vie en Rose!
